        "description": "## POST `/reports/force_evaluate`\n\nForce medrecord evaluation to done for the booking of the given `medrecord_id`.\n\n### Form fields\n| Field | Required | Notes |\n|-------|----------|-------|\n| `token` | yes | Auth token |\n| `requester` | yes | User id + audit `force_evaluate_by` |\n| `medrecord_id` | yes | Report DB `medrecord.id` |\n\n### Success\nReturns the updated medrecord row for the requested id (`{ \"data\": { ... } }`). Sibling rows for the same booking are updated the same way but only this id is returned.\n\n### Errors\n- `400` — missing `medrecord_id`\n- `404` — medrecord not found or update failed\n- `401` — invalid/missing API-KEY, token, or requester"
